      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORO LOCO (7) is in good form at present. Finished fifth at his latest appearance over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten 9 metres. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. This doesn't look as hard so he is in the right race to find the winners' list. IM BUSTED (1) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1780m at this track, finishing second and just a head from the winner. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. This looks a sterner test than last time but on his best form he is capable of another big performance. OUR ULTIMATE MILLY (3) ended last prep with a fifth at Albion Park over 2138m five months ago. Capable of a forward showing while fresh. KING BLING (2) is worth some thought despite his last-start 12th over 2138m at Albion Park on August 25.",
